   <HaulersDream.Setting.BuildFromInventoryPartialDesc>Normally a build won't start unless enough material for the whole thing is available. With this on, a frame is started and advanced using whatever inventory material exists even if it's less than the full amount needed — the rest is delivered as more becomes available. Changes the base-game all-or-nothing rule, so it's off by default. Requires "Build from inventory (use already-carried materials)".</HaulersDream.Setting.BuildFromInventoryPartialDesc>
