-  <HaulersDream.Setting.ShareForCraftingDesc>When enabled, crafting bills can use carried materials tracked by Hauler's Dream, including the crafter's own stock. This option does not make untracked personal items available to bills. When Common Sense gathers ingredients, HD leaves ingredient selection and gathering for ordinary bills to it.</HaulersDream.Setting.ShareForCraftingDesc>
+  <HaulersDream.Setting.ShareForCraftingDesc>When enabled, crafting bills can use carried materials tracked by Hauler's Dream, including the crafter's own stock. This option does not make untracked personal items available to bills. When Common Sense gathers ingredients, HD does not add carried stock to ordinary bills' ingredient searches and leaves gathering to Common Sense.</HaulersDream.Setting.ShareForCraftingDesc>
   <HaulersDream.Setting.ShareMeetInMiddle>An idle carrier walks toward the worker to hand over goods</HaulersDream.Setting.ShareMeetInMiddle>
   <HaulersDream.Setting.BatchWorkDeliveries>Carry materials for many queued builds per trip</HaulersDream.Setting.BatchWorkDeliveries>
   <HaulersDream.Setting.BatchWorkDeliveriesDesc>When building lots of cheap things (e.g. a long fence), a pawn fills its hands with enough material for many queued builds and delivers to each in one trip, instead of shuttling a few at a time. Carried in hands, so there's no slowdown.</HaulersDream.Setting.BatchWorkDeliveriesDesc>
